1ki194 but he himself went a day's journey into the wilderness and came and sat down under a juniper tree and he requested for himself that he might die and said it is enough now o lord take away my life for i am not better than my fathers
1ki195 and as he lay and slept under a juniper tree behold then an angel touched him and said unto him arise and eat
