1chr634 the son of elkanah the son of jeroham the son of eliel the son of toah
1chr635 the son of zuph the son of elkanah the son of mahath the son of amasai
1chr636 the son of elkanah the son of joel the son of azariah the son of zephaniah
1chr637 the son of tahath the son of assir the son of ebiasaph the son of korah
